Bernard Gaulle <gaulle@circe.fr> has submitted another working paper to the
LaTeX3 library -- vt15d02.tex.

This article suggests basic definitions which will be used by the working
group on multilingual documents, which he is coordinator of.  You may
retrieve the paper via e-mail by including:
 SENDME LTX3PUB.VT15D02_TEX
and the styles it relies upon by also including:
 SENDME LTX3PUB.DRAFT_STY
 SENDME LTX3PUB.BNF_STY
 SENDME LTX3PUB.L3MS001_STY
in the body of a mail message to FILESERV@SHSU.BITNET (FILESERV@SHSU.edu).
These files are also available for anonymous ftp retrieval from
Niord.SHSU.edu (192.92.115.8) in [FILESERV.LTX3PUB] and via Gopher from
Niord.SHSU.edu (port 70) in:
 TeX-related Materials/
   LaTeX3 Public Document Library/

Regards,   George
